// INDIAN ALLIANCE SERVICES — GOOGLE APPS SCRIPT LEAD WEBHOOK
// ================================================================
// How to use:
// 1. Open your Google Sheet -> Click "Extensions" -> "Apps Script"
// 2. Delete existing code and paste this entire script
